OL,3,GNEWSA'Best night' of Daithi's life all
OL,4,Athanks to organ donation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 10-year-old boy who inspired changes
OL,7,Fto Northern Ireland's organ donation
OL,8,Flaws "skipped" onto the pitch as a
OL,9,Fmascot at the Republic of Ireland match
OL,10,Fon Tuesday evening.
OL,12,FIt was "the best night of his life" and
OL,13,Fis something he would not have been
OL,14,Fable to do without the gift of a new
OL,15,Fheart, his father Mairtin said.
OL,17,FDaithi Mac Gabhann received a
OL,18,Ftransplant in July after an eight-year
OL,19,Fwait, and his father said he is "doing
OL,20,Fincredible" and "living his life to the
OL,21,Fabsolute fullest".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
