OL,3,GNEWSA'Best night' of Daithi's life all
OL,4,Athanks to organ donation
OL,5,
OL,6,FDaithi walked out with Republic of
OL,7,FIreland's Troy Parrott as Ireland won
OL,8,F3-0 over Kosovo in the Nations League,
OL,9,Fwith Parrott having scored two of the
OL,10,Fgoals.
